flowchart TD
    Q["Question"] --> G["Generate answer + factual steps<br/>(FACTUAL_REASONING_PROMPT)"]
    G --> D["Decompose steps → atomic claims<br/>(+ final-answer step)"]
    D --> CL{"For each claim"}
    CL --> W["Web search (gpt-4.1-mini, web_search tool)<br/>up to 5 cited sources"]
    W --> PF["Fetch page text when snippet<br/>relevance < 0.2"]
    PF --> R["Source reliability (22-tier policy)<br/>KEEP / DOWN_WEIGHT / REJECT"]
    R --> EV["Evidence retrieval<br/>drop REJECT, keep relevance ≥ 0.2"]
    EV --> AS["LLM assessment per source<br/>SUPPORT / CONTRADICT / UNKNOWN,<br/>confidence, essential"]
    AS --> SIG["Signals: self-verification,<br/>verdict consistency, evidence score"]
    SIG --> FU["Fuse 0.4 / 0.3 / 0.3 → σ(−1 + 3.2f)"]
    FU --> CL
    CL -- done --> AGG["Step probability = min over its claims<br/>Flagged step = argmin<br/>Answer confidence = geometric mean of essential claims"]
